WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.100
Imagine you've just said done to Quickler and your record is filing.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.720
You're back at the car, and you notice a fault as you leave that you didn't mention.

3
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.980
Just tell Quickler straight away, and the record is amended.

4
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.980
That way, nothing gets left out.
